WEBVTT

00:00:00.315 --> 00:00:02.740
Replace send the approved answer with a check

00:00:02.829 --> 00:00:05.748
that approval matches the current version and intended

00:00:05.883 --> 00:00:11.633
recipient. Add a missing-approval exception: stop, keep unsent,

00:00:11.857 --> 00:00:14.552
refer to the confirmed reviewer and record the

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:17.187
hold. Keep the original wording and explain why

00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:20.016
it required guessing. Walk through the corrected document

00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:24.059
using the same normal and exception samples. Save

00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:27.427
actual results and the correction. If retesting is

00:00:27.472 --> 00:00:30.724
pending, say so. A human decides whether the

00:00:30.768 --> 00:00:33.688
guidance is usable within its boundary; this exercise

00:00:34.002 --> 00:00:36.289
does not create organizational policy.
